---
title: Ingreso Funcionarios
permalink: funcionarios/ingresar.html
---
{% import "componentes.njk" as ui with context %}
{{ ui.tituloPortal("Portal Funcionarios", "Acceso exclusivo para funcionarios del Hospital de Frutillar", "lock") }}

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12" data-pagina="ingresar">
  <div class="max-w-md mx-auto bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-custom shadow-md overflow-hidden gob-stripe">
    <form id="form-ingreso" class="px-8 py-8 flex flex-col gap-5" novalidate>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-primary">Iniciar sesión</h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">Ingrese con su RUT y contraseña.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="rut" class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-600 mb-1">RUT</label>
        <input id="rut" name="rut" type="text" inputmode="text" autocomplete="username" required placeholder="12.345.678-9" maxlength="12" data-rut class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-custom px-3 py-2.5 text-sm focus:border-primary focus:ring-primary-pale">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="clave" class="block text-xs font-bold text-gray-600 mb-1">Contraseña</label>
        <div class="relative">
          <input id="clave" name="clave" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required class="w-full border-gray-300 rounded-custom px-3 py-2.5 pr-11 text-sm focus:border-primary focus:ring-primary-pale">
          <button type="button" data-ver-clave="clave" class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 px-3 text-gray-400 hover:text-primary" aria-label="Mostrar contraseña">
            <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">visibility</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p id="mensaje" role="alert" class="hidden text-sm rounded-custom px-4 py-3 bg-red-50 text-red-700 border border-red-200"></p>
      <button type="submit" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-dark disabled:opacity-60 text-white font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-custom transition-colors shadow">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">login</span>Ingresar
      </button>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed border-t border-gray-100 pt-4">
        ¿Olvidó su contraseña o no tiene cuenta? Solicítela a la Subdirección Médica o al administrador del portal, quien le entregará una contraseña temporal.
      </p>
    </form>
  </div>
</div>
